docs {
  ## Delete Order — Active

  Tests deleting an ACTIVE order (not allowed).
  Replace `ACTIVE_ORDER_UUID` with an order in ACTIVE status.

  Expected: 400 Bad Request — "Only pending orders can be deleted"
}
